        "nobel_worthiness": "Virus-like particle vaccination against HPV is a major preventive-medicine achievement with a direct route to reducing cancer burden.",
        "attribution": "The three proposed laureates provide a coherent attribution for the scientific basis and development of HPV VLP vaccines.",
        "maturity": "Prevention of HPV infection and related disease is mature and demonstrated at population scale.",
