      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Identification of CFTR transformed understanding of cystic fibrosis and created a foundation for molecular diagnosis and treatment.",
        "attribution": "Tsui, Collins, and Riordan form a recognizable and limited group for the gene-identification achievement.",
        "maturity": "The discovery has had decades of mechanistic and medical confirmation.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The discovery is longstanding, and its relation to later CFTR therapeutic advances requires clear prize framing."
