        "attribution": "June, Sadelain, and Rosenberg represent pivotal clinical and conceptual contributions, although the field is broad.",
        "maturity": "Clinical efficacy, regulatory translation, and continuing expansion of the platform support maturity.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The many enabling contributions to cell engineering and cancer immunotherapy make exclusive attribution difficult."
        ]
